alse,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":345,"closed_issues":2336,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:21:32Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-03T02:22:48Z","updated_at":"2026-10-03T02:22:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124121","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124121","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124121.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124121.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123572\r\n- Supersedes/Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123667\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis fix ensure to retrieve the frame speed which is considered when decrementing the remaining time after the frame has been updated. It separates `frame_speed_scale` from the `speed` variable and multiplies only that scale later. Since `speed` is used solely for handling exceptions and determining the direction of progress, and `frame_duration` is guaranteed to be `>= 0.01`, this separation does not affect the existing behavior.\r\n\r\nAlso unify the direction-dependent calculation of `frame_progress`. `abs()` was actually meaningless and forced a sign inversion when calculating `frame_progress`. Removing `abs()` has unified and simplified the calculation.\r\n\r\nThis fix will change the timeline of existing behavior and SpriteAnimation with non-uniform frame times, but it is difficult to see the difference in cases that only include common scaling factors such as x2 or x0.5, so I think this not to be a breaking change.\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c7750fdd-555c-446d-bf79-6df062bfe7ff\r\n\r\nAfter fix:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4a1a5f4-d90f-480b-ba03-ec6b28f69389\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124121/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124121/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}